      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.27,
          "en": "Now slots are an important feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.27,
          "end": 5.5,
          "en": "and as you can tell by now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.5,
          "end": 7.58,
          "en": "all are quite powerful feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.58,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "and you can do a lot of things with them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 10.95,
          "en": "in Vue as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.95,
          "end": 13.1,
          "en": "Now there's one last thing about slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.1,
          "end": 14.72,
          "en": "which I also want to mention here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 14.72,
          "end": 16.34,
          "en": "It's definitely advanced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 16.34,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "but it is worth knowing about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 21.223,
          "en": "For that I'm going to create a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 21.223,
          "end": 25.86,
          "en": "CourseGoals.vue and I'm going to add a template here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.86,
          "end": 28.75,
          "en": "and in that template I wanna output a list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.75,
          "end": 29.85,
          "en": "And for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.85,
          "end": 32.77,
          "en": "I'll not care too much about the styling and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.77,
          "end": 35.41,
          "en": "I just wanna focus on this slots feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.41,
          "end": 37.03,
          "en": "which I wanna show to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.03,
          "end": 38.78,
          "en": "So I have unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 38.78,
          "end": 40.85,
          "en": "and I have a script here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 40.85,
          "end": 44.17,
          "en": "defining my config object for this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.17,
          "end": 46.49,
          "en": "and in there let's say we have some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.49,
          "end": 48.07,
          "en": "and we have some goals in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.07,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "which of course could be dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 50.57,
          "en": "but for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 50.57,
          "end": 52.29,
          "en": "I'll justify them like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 52.29,
          "end": 56.883,
          "en": "Simple strings like finish the course and learn Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 59.39,
          "end": 62.17,
          "en": "So definitely nothing too fancy here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.17,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "Now of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 67.56,
          "en": "we can render list items here with v-for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 67.56,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "by looping through our goals as you learned it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 72.96000000000001,
          "en": "We can also add that key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.96000000000001,
          "end": 75.19,
          "en": "and set that to our goal for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.19,
          "end": 76.25,
          "en": "So to that string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.25,
          "end": 79.033,
          "en": "assuming that every string is unique in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 83.24,
          "en": "And then of course we can output our goal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.24,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "and now we could go to App.vue for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 90.38,
          "en": "there, import this newly created component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 90.38,
          "end": 95.38,
          "en": "So import CourseGoals from './components/CourseGoals.vue'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.02000000000001,
          "end": 102.36,
          "en": "and there after, register it as a local component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.36,
          "end": 104.793,
          "en": "so that we can then use it in the template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 107.45,
          "en": "So let's do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.45,
          "end": 112.45,
          "en": "And that will simply add it here course-goals, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.32,
          "end": 115.75,
          "en": "So now I added my component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.75,
          "end": 117.41,
          "en": "and hence we see the goals here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.41,
          "end": 119.86,
          "en": "And as I mentioned, the styling is off",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.86,
          "end": 121.87,
          "en": "but that's not the focus here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.87,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "Now, what that does this have to do with slots?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 127.81,
          "en": "Sometimes if you're building a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.81,
          "end": 130.38,
          "en": "which you might wanna share with our people",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.38,
          "end": 131.62,
          "en": "with our colleagues",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 131.62,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "or which gets used in different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 135.43,
          "en": "in a bigger project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.43,
          "end": 136.263,
          "en": "you want to make",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.263,
          "end": 140.11,
          "en": "certain aspects of that component customizable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.11,
          "end": 142.93,
          "en": "For example here we could have this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.93,
          "end": 145.03,
          "en": "which has the CourseGoals data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.03,
          "end": 148.69,
          "en": "which maybe also has more logic related to that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.69,
          "end": 150.62,
          "en": "and which then takes care about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.62,
          "end": 153.003,
          "en": "rendering those Course Goals to the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 153.97,
          "end": 156.06,
          "en": "But there's one thing which you might wanna make",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 157.38,
          "en": "customizable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 160.913,
          "en": "And that is the content of every list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 161.75,
          "end": 163.12,
          "en": "With that I mean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 163.12,
          "end": 165.82,
          "en": "if you just have the text in the list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 165.82,
          "end": 168.57999999999998,
          "en": "if you maybe have an h2 tag in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 168.57999999999998,
          "end": 170.57,
          "en": "maybe multiple elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 170.57,
          "end": 174.09,
          "en": "So maybe you want to make that customizable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 174.09,
          "end": 176.11,
          "en": "So that this core skills component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 176.11,
          "end": 178.93,
          "en": "could be used in different parts of the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.93,
          "end": 180.8,
          "en": "but the content of the list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 180.8,
          "end": 183.333,
          "en": "could be different every time it is getting used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 184.19,
          "end": 185.64,
          "en": "Now for that we could of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 185.64,
          "end": 188.04,
          "en": "think about using a slot here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 189.95,
          "en": "We could enter a slot here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 189.95,
          "end": 191.89,
          "en": "and if we have a slot here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 191.89,
          "end": 194.48,
          "en": "the content the HTML markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 194.48,
          "end": 196.53,
          "en": "which is passed to a list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 196.53,
          "end": 199.17000000000002,
          "en": "can be defined from inside the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 199.17000000000002,
          "end": 201.03300000000002,
          "en": "where Course Goals gets used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 202.07,
          "end": 205.7,
          "en": "And that sounds exactly like what I'm trying to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 205.7,
          "end": 208.7,
          "en": "So in App.vue where I'm using Course Goal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 208.7,
          "end": 212.31,
          "en": "I could now pass in my content for a Course Goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 212.31,
          "end": 215.04,
          "en": "And I could say that I want to have my goal text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 215.04,
          "end": 216.733,
          "en": "instead of a h2 tech here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 217.61,
          "end": 219.93,
          "en": "But that's now where the problem start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 219.93,
          "end": 222.32999999999998,
          "en": "Yes I can pass in my markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 222.32999999999998,
          "end": 223.96,
          "en": "but I have a big problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 223.96,
          "end": 227.52,
          "en": "I don't have access to the individual goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 227.52,
          "end": 229.98,
          "en": "for which this list item is getting rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 229.98,
          "end": 233.43,
          "en": "This goal variable is only available here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 233.43,
          "end": 235.23,
          "en": "inside of Course Goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 235.23,
          "end": 238.24,
          "en": "but the markup which should be output in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 238.24,
          "end": 241.36,
          "en": "is getting passed in from App.vue here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 241.36,
          "end": 243.95,
          "en": "And here I don't have access to these goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 243.95,
          "end": 247.49,
          "en": "or goal variables, which I'm using in Course Goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 247.49,
          "end": 250.01,
          "en": "And for this specific scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 250.01,
          "end": 252.39,
          "en": "where you wanna to build something like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 252.39,
          "end": 254.2,
          "en": "Vue has another feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 254.2,
          "end": 257.26,
          "en": "It has scoped slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 257.26,
          "end": 259.383,
          "en": "Now what are scoped slots about?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 260.5,
          "end": 264.79,
          "en": "The concept of scoped slots is about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 264.79,
          "end": 267.29,
          "en": "letting you pass data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 267.29,
          "end": 271.13,
          "en": "from inside the component where you defined a slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 271.13,
          "end": 272.65,
          "en": "to the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 272.65,
          "end": 276.51,
          "en": "where you pass the markup for the slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 276.51,
          "end": 278.56,
          "en": "And you do that by going to the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 278.56,
          "end": 280.14,
          "en": "where you have the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 280.14,
          "end": 281.98,
          "en": "and where you define the slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 281.98,
          "end": 284.38,
          "en": "and then on the slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 284.38,
          "end": 287.95,
          "en": "you can add a prop. For example, goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 287.95,
          "end": 289.47,
          "en": "This name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 289.47,
          "end": 292.4,
          "en": "And you can also bind it with v-bind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 292.4,
          "end": 295.65999999999997,
          "en": "or with the shortened to a dynamic value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 295.65999999999997,
          "end": 298.19,
          "en": "In my case here, to goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 298.19,
          "end": 300.95,
          "en": "And to avoid naming confusion here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 300.95,
          "end": 302.39,
          "en": "I'll name this item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 302.39,
          "end": 304.803,
          "en": "though you could absolutely also use goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 305.84,
          "end": 306.94,
          "en": "That would be okay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 306.94,
          "end": 308.16,
          "en": "but to make it clearer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 308.16,
          "end": 310.39,
          "en": "I'll name my prop item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 310.39,
          "end": 311.9,
          "en": "and past this goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 311.9,
          "end": 315.203,
          "en": "which is created for every iteration, queue item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 316.88,
          "end": 318.43,
          "en": "Now these names are up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 318.43,
          "end": 322.26,
          "en": "but whatever you set as props on slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 322.26,
          "end": 324.52,
          "en": "so on this slot element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 324.52,
          "end": 327.53,
          "en": "will now be accessible in the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 327.53,
          "end": 330.26,
          "en": "where you pass data for that slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 330.26,
          "end": 332.3,
          "en": "In this case here in App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 332.3,
          "end": 335.453,
          "en": "where I'm passing this markup for my slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 336.37,
          "end": 338.85,
          "en": "And here we can now get access to the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 338.85,
          "end": 340.81,
          "en": "by adding a template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 340.81,
          "end": 343.23,
          "en": "around our slot markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 343.23,
          "end": 346.82,
          "en": "So around the markup which we wanna to pass into that slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 346.82,
          "end": 349.78,
          "en": "and on that template, we use v-slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 349.78,
          "end": 350.89,
          "en": "or the shortened",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 351.85,
          "end": 354.84000000000003,
          "en": "for the default slot in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 354.84000000000003,
          "end": 358.5,
